            <hr class="divider">
            <p style="max-width: 983px;"><strong>Wednesday, May 24, 1995</strong><br>
              KnowsMore proudly announces that the website is available to the
              public! KnowsMore is a search engine that supports natural
              language queries. I gather data from vintage encyclopedias,
              dictionaries, and thesauruses, digitizing the information on the
              web. Rest assured, I will provide the best answers to your
              queries, just like the fabled Library of Alexandria! </p>
            <hr class="divider">
